<title>USA: Boston $90 mln GOs won by Merrill at 4.94 pct TIC. [corrected 19:05 gmt]</title>
<headline>Boston $90 mln GOs won by Merrill at 4.94 pct TIC. [corrected 19:05 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects true interest cost in headline and text from &quot;4.924&quot;)</p>
